s more to the game besides cooking Fish Bread!\n*Enjoy the unique, cartoony art style, and make colorful and animated Fish Bread snacks.\n*Interact with cute Fish Bread Fairies.\n*Complete the game missions and engage in funny cutscenes with the Fish Bread Fairies.\n*Sell Fish Bread and develop your business.\nMake your street stall the most popular stop in downtown!\n\n\nSatisfy your impatient customers. Keep troublemakers away from your business. Become a master Fish Bread Chef. Do you have what it takes?\n", "short_description": "Let the world know about fish bread!\nWake up the fish bread fairies to learn a variety of menus, satisfy the customers, and protect the store from the villains!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://visuallight.kr/notice/?vid=6", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VisualLight Co., Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://visuallight.kr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "FOOD", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1574389679594685"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "353237596276858"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "353237596276858"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1642669200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "353237596276858"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": 